If you like this
type of content,

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:04.030
then feel free to
watch more episodes

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:07.490
on architecting in Google Cloud
or subscribe to the channel.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:07.990
Cheers.

